# Used by `wrangler dev` when bindings are configured in wrangler.toml.
# Replace IMAGE_API_BASE_URL with the independent image-host API before testing
# image operations. IMAGE_API_TOKEN is a local-only placeholder; production uses a Worker Secret.
# D1 and independent image-host R2 resources are configured outside this file.
